  "description": "Divide: Master the Most Remote Paths with Confidence\nConquer the world’s most challenging and remote trails with the Divide, our rugged 29\"-wheeled adventure bike. Built for explorers who need a bike that can handle anything—even the lines you find on Google Earth—the Divide will take you further than you ever thought possible.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c / 29\" Wheels: Compatible with 45mm–55mm tires for ultimate traction and stability on varied surfaces.\n\nRugged Reynolds 725 Steel Tubing: Built tough with an integrated chainstay yoke, providing the durability needed for harsh environments.\n\nSteel Uni-Crown Touring Fork: Delivers precise handling, even with a fully-loaded bike on rough trails. Comes standard with 3 front-rack mounting points.\n\nCo-Motion Touring Geometry: Designed for maximum comfort and control, perfect for long-distance expeditions.\n\nRack, Fender, and Bottle Mounts: Ready for extended adventures, with three bottle mounts to keep you hydrated no matter where the road takes you.\n\nMechanical Disc Brakes and Hand-Built Wheels: Dependable stopping power and rugged wheels that can withstand any terrain.\n\nHandlebar Options:\n\nRoad drop bars for a sleek, racing feel\nMountain/trekking handlebars for maximum comfort on long rides\n\nNo matter where you're headed, the Divide is your reliable companion for conquering the world's most remote paths. Get ready to take on any challenge with this robust and versatile bike.\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Divide order started!",
